<title>FRANCE: BDDP wins Lyonnaise youth jobs campaign.</title>
<headline>BDDP wins Lyonnaise youth jobs campaign.</headline>
<text>
<p>PARIS, Feb 12, Reuter -  French advertising agency BDDP is running a six-million-franc press campaign for water and utilities group Lyonnaise des Eaux to promote youth employment, a Lyonnaise spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;This campaign, awarded to BDDP, represents a purchase of 50 slots in the national press for six million francs,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>The campaign, which has as its slogan, &quot;Let's create jobs and open doors&quot;, aimed to mark publicly Lyonnaise's committment to stimulate training schemes and to promote employment in growth areas such as environmental protection, construction and communication, a Lyonnaise statement said.</p>
<p>The campaign was launched on February 11 and is to run for three months.</p>
</text>
